"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Amite County runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years in all. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, May to June and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 46% of normal in November to December. In 2026 so far, the middle ran 175% of normal in May to June.</p>"}
